   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "ACID -> ACD: the isolation given up, and what replaces the free rollback",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "ACID -> ACD: the isolation given up, and what replaces the free rollback",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 16
  },
  {
   "id": "t1379978923",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 262,
   "width": 895.4000000000001,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#555555",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 595987346,
   "versionNonce": 1035581433,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Atomic + Consistent + Isolated + Durable: all four, free, because there is one process and one database. Any failure anywhere rolls back everything.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Atomic + Consistent + Isolated + Durable: all four, free, because there is one process and one database. Any failure anywhere rolls back everything.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t1517895222",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 565,
   "width": 1034.5500000000002,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#555555",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 923057372,
   "versionNonce": 651568812,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Kept: full LOCAL ACID inside each service's own database. Given up: atomicity and isolation ACROSS services: four commits on four DBs, each independent of the other three.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Kept: full LOCAL ACID inside each service's own database. Given up: atomicity and isolation ACROSS services: four commits on four DBs, each independent of the other three.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t1227048116",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 581,
   "width": 913.5500000000001,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#555555",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 255237238,
   "versionNonce": 1811836587,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Atomic (locally) + Consistent (eventually) + Durable survive as ACD. No cross-service isolation is what is given up: not a value judgement, a tradeoff.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Atomic (locally) + Consistent (eventually) + Durable survive as ACD. No cross-service isolation is what is given up: not a value judgement, a tradeoff.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
